+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 1 and Theorem 1.2 give the k=2 target n-8, while "
+        "the domain-standard algorithm for this uniform-matroid specialization "
+        "regularises the bipartite incidence graph and performs repeated "
